          "location": "Beregost, a patron's door",
          "actors": 1,
          "droppedPcActors": [],
          "narration": "Bram Halloway, Sefa Marrin and Pell Dunmore stand together at a patron's door in Beregost, where the town's forges still ring along the lane. Each of them was hired this morning by the same patron, and each has the same claim on the work ahead. The patron, Tamsin Corrow, waits in the doorway with the terms of the errand, and the light over the rooftops is already going. Nightfall is the limit set for the task. The door stands open, and the next move is theirs.",
